img2blender is a Blender-native adaptation of the img2threejs reconstruction workflow.
Source: https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
Fork workflow: https://github.com/rocketjo90/img2threejs at 5c2aa65e2c288b641e54e88c0f3aba0f4f7ded22
Original workflow material is distributed under Apache License 2.0.
This distribution adds new Python project management and headless Blender execution code,
and adapts the reference, review and delivery guidance for native Blender output.
It is not a release of the upstream img2threejs project or an affiliation with Blender.
